{"title":"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 6","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/6/6/1661ac6f3544a6f06f111d5e09c7072da8bb76e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle BAD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"62\" height=\"18\" /> is right-angled at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" />. On <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/5/bc56862b1fdb71204894da278e42ef75de73a40b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" /> there is a point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c3355896da590fc491a10150a50416687626d7cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> for which <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/d/5/7d592aa350614d8ce156d364678ac3e3bb93d203.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AC=CD$\" width=\"81\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/f/4/5f4c25cb7b6078137512af0317bd262160bd0319.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB=BC$\" width=\"81\" height=\"13\" />. The magnitude of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/b/1/8b1fc15d59287d2ff7bf581a84f348b3207a0c64.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle DAB$\" width=\"56\" height=\"13\" /> is:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/3/1/d31e403a11d8f5236bfb2358cb048f24eb3a624b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 67\\tfrac{1}{2}^{\\circ}\\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ 60^{\\circ}\\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ 45^{\\circ}\\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ 30^{\\circ}\\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ 22\\tfrac{1}{2}^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"452\" height=\"22\" />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/8/5/585d2640fc22f8bedf6d2de8b99f16d076d93027.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] draw((0,0)--(0,10)--(17.321,0)--(0,0)); draw((0,0)--(8.661,5)); dot((0,0)); label(&quot;$B$&quot;,(0,0),SW); dot((0,10)); label(&quot;$A$&quot;,(0,10),NW); dot((17.321,0)); label(&quot;$D$&quot;,(17.321,0),SE); dot((8.661,5)); label(&quot;$C$&quot;,(8.661,5),NE); [/asy]\" width=\"252\" height=\"162\" />\nNote that because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c3355896da590fc491a10150a50416687626d7cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> is the midpoint of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/5/bc56862b1fdb71204894da278e42ef75de73a40b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c3355896da590fc491a10150a50416687626d7cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> is the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Circumcenter\" title=\"Circumcenter\">circumcenter</a> of the triangle, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/f/c6f4933af37d02db044fffd74c1bf03bedf67ce6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BC = AC = AB$\" width=\"133\" height=\"13\" />.  Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c3a2d2224f7d163b46d702132425d47828bf538.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"61\" height=\"18\" /> is equilateral, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/5/1/4517045bcf7d6fb49ebc219c1d30ac111fc7047e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle DAB = 60^{\\circ}$\" width=\"105\" height=\"13\" />, which is answer choice <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/1/a2194b81820e8380be586c1564c3f5d03d5c100d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"42\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME\" title=\"1963 AHSME\">1963 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1963 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1963\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">Problem 5</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">Problem 7</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" ti